  "worked_solution": "To determine the distance between Margaret and Juan, we calculate the difference between Margaret's location and Juan's location. This gives\n\n$$\n2-(-13)=2+13=15\\,\\text{m}.\n$$\n\nTherefore, Margaret and Juan are $15\\,\\text{m}$ apart.",
